  "correct": "3",
  "solution": "The correct answer is option(3)\n\nBy using BODMAS and going by the options\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/13bc0065c96e715682af7c8a6dc1b4c567b7a2a89597cc68809a5ff942c7e421.png] \n\n**Given Equation:- 17*18*6*5*2*10**\n\nInterchanging * with signs\n\n**Option(1) ×, -, ÷, +, =**\n\n⇒ 17 × 18 - 6 ÷ 5 + 2 = 10\n\n⇒ 17 × 18 - 1.2 + 2 = 10\n\n⇒ 136 - 1.2 + 2 = 10\n\n⇒ 138 -1.2 = 10\n\n⇒ 136. 8 = 10\n\n**⇒ LHS ≠ RHS **\n\n**Option(2) ×, -, +, ÷, =**\n\n⇒ 17 × 18 - 6 + 5 ÷ 2 = 10\n\n⇒ 17 × 18 - 6 + 2.5 = 10\n\n⇒ 306 - 6 + 2.5 = 10\n\n⇒ 308.5 - 6 = 10\n\n⇒ 302.5 = 10\n\n**⇒ LHS ≠ RHS **\n\n**Option(3) +, ÷, -, ×, = **\n\n⇒ 17 + 18 ÷ 6 - 5 × 2 = 10\n\n⇒ 17 + 3 - 5 × 2 =10\n\n⇒ 17 + 3 - 10 = 10\n\n⇒ 20 -10 = 10\n\n⇒ 10 = 10\n\n**⇒ LHS = RHS**\n\n**Option(4) +, ×, ÷, -, =**\n\n⇒ 17 + 18 × 6 ÷ 5 - 2 = 10\n\n⇒ 17 + 18 × 1.2 - 2 = 10\n\n⇒ 17 + 21.6 - 2 = 10\n\n⇒ 38.6 - 2 = 10\n\n⇒ 36.6 = 10 \n\n**⇒ LHS ≠ RHS**\n\nTherefore, only option(3) satisfies the above equation.\n\nHence, the correct answer is** option(3)**",
